{"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.069958845774332645,"c":0.5,"x":0.7716049391467531,"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","h":0.008720930389296444},{"t":"TEST 3","x":0.39913950286273497,"y":0.097258345186052919,"w":0.096782722473144567,"h":0.014785635176480016,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.09471694310506186,"t":"PART 1","x":0.10078967610112026,"y":0.15250706005824399,"h":0.014753321455561186},{"x":0.10280440814302748,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.18144638463158702,"w":0.053650442759195963,"h":0.00920025395279922},{"w":0.039094648361206047,"y":0.21075581384397302,"x":0.10082304610893256,"t":"JACK:","h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"x":0.10278187282267438,"y":0.26858228464885125,"w":0.053695513407389331,"c":1,"h":0.0093470585781496585,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"y":0.29651162800041875,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"t":"JACK:","w":0.039094648361206047,"x":0.10082304611260687,"c":1},{"w":0.05558435440063475,"h":0.010253174987361779,"x":0.10286625966573243,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.3110071332679023},{"x":0.10082304611432155,"w":0.039094648361206047,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"y":0.34011627896232843,"t":"JACK:"},{"y":0.35452480730804536,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.053579362233479824,"h":0.0089736411652940884,"c":1,"x":0.10283994840985249},{"x":0.10082304615890315,"y":0.36918604638965413,"w":0.039094648361206061,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"JACK:"},{"c":1,"y":0.39821577891368021,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.053523985544840502,"h":0.0088010002783245334,"x":0.10286763675437929},{"h":0.008720930389296333,"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1,"y":0.41279069757182474,"x":0.1008230445031451,"t":"JACK:"},{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.10288065758766206,"y":0.44186046502113885,"w":0.053497943878173845,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1},{"t":"JACK:","y":0.45494186055855823,"w":0.039094648361206047,"x":0.10082304611260687,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"c":1},{"x":0.10282003251573622,"h":0.0090998940529615213,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.4838221459786336,"w":0.053619194030761722,"c":1},{"t":"JACK:","h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10082304615890315,"y":0.49854651150593321,"w":0.039094648361206061,"c":1},{"h":0.010500729294631972,"c":1,"x":0.10282167539293549,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.055673522949218734,"y":0.52599963518694748},{"w":0.039094651540120456,"t":"JACK:","h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.54215116268667862,"c":1,"x":0.10082304449742949},{"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.055637734731038418,"y":0.58416979340002373,"h":0.0089859945614009229,"x":0.10283956874542738,"c":1},{"h":0.012038409499313341,"c":1,"x":0.1002057578871825,"y":0.59752046652467028,"w":0.040571295420328779,"t":"JACK:"},{"x":0.1008230448468318,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.61337209289723038,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.057613169352213556},{"x":0.10082304450385952,"w":0.039094651540120443,"t":"JACK:","y":0.62790697663856399,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"h":0.010427097549708053,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.10283306366857443,"y":0.64086203244768258,"w":0.053593133290608733,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120443,"t":"JACK:","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.65697674408345252,"x":0.1008230445031451},{"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10288065758766206,"y":0.68604651153276675,"w":0.053497943878173845,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.70058139524624319,"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120443,"t":"JACK:","x":0.1008230445031451},{"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.7281976745483838,"w":0.053497943878173831,"x":0.10288065793059759,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"c":1},{"y":0.763081395253697,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.053497943878173845,"x":0.10288065758766206,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"JACK:","c":1,"x":0.1008230445031451,"y":0.77761627896717345,"w":0.039094651540120443},{"y":0.7902722994852136,"w":0.057945632934570321,"c":1,"x":0.1006568136295198,"h":0.012478656566606405,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"JACK:","y":0.80668604640903396,"x":0.1008230445031451,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1},{"x":0.19341563022081915,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"y":0.18021201415817956,"t":"Jack, I'm thinking of taking the kids to the seaside on a surfing holiday this","w":0.54938273111979163},{"w":0.55967076619466138,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.19341564561733568,"t":"summer and I wanted to ask your advice - as I know you're such an expert.","y":0.1961130739413337},{"y":0.20930232547489136,"w":0.59876541137695316,"x":0.1934156481181078,"c":1,"t":"Well, I don't know about that, but yes, I've done a bit of surfing over the years. I'd","h":0.011627907185728592},{"w":0.58024693806966143,"y":0.22379269709254412,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.193415625495057,"c":1,"t":"thoroughly recommend it. I think it's the kind of holiday all the family can enjoy."},{"x":0.19341564090109292,"t":"together. The thing about surfing is that it's great for all ages and all abilities. My","h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.59053497314453129,"y":0.23837209291659422,"c":1},{"w":0.3106995900472006,"y":0.25290697663484885,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.19341563699886202,"t":"youngest started when he was only three!","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.26590106020225313,"x":0.19341564582004822,"w":0.5596707661946615,"t":"Wow! But it's quite physically demanding, isn't it? I've heard you need to be","h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.014065821123066979,"t":"pretty fit.","y":0.28003104280037383,"w":0.06622189839680992,"c":1,"x":0.19116888648447361},{"h":0.011778563015311994,"t":"Yes. You'll certainly learn more quickly and won't tire as easily.","y":0.29505300373986176,"x":0.1934156434052709,"w":0.46296295166015627,"c":1},{"x":0.19341562928009665,"t":"Well - that should be OK for us. You've been surfing a few times in Ireland,","w":0.55555557250976562,"h":0.013250883392226021,"y":0.30948174315954113,"c":1},{"w":0.096825122833251925,"x":0.19335698580323221,"t":"haven't you?","h":0.012125073669936759,"c":1,"y":0.32387932361804994},{"y":0.33863368666150517,"c":1,"t":"Yes. There's some great surfing there, which people don't always realise.","h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.54526748657226565,"x":0.19135802615300426},{"x":0.19341564466015296,"t":"And which locations would you recommend? - there seem to be quite a few.","h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.35306242610746996,"c":1,"w":0.56584360758463548},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.57818929036458333,"c":1,"x":0.19341564278067133,"t":"Yes, there are loads. Last year we went to County Donegal. There are several","y":0.36773255801965343},{"t":"great places to surf there.","y":0.38221436960191701,"x":0.1934156357896776,"w":0.193415641784668,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"t":"What about in County Clare? I read that's also really good for surfing.","y":0.39525577174044546,"x":0.1933628820862677,"w":0.51244033813476564,"h":0.014379415410988861,"c":1},{"x":0.19341564905964995,"y":0.40988372081039981,"w":0.59259256998697918,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Yes, it is. I've been there a few times. Most people go to Lahinch. My kids love it"},{"t":"there. The waves aren't too challenging and the town is very lively.","x":0.19127487338701768,"w":0.49197484334309904,"c":1,"y":0.42279595670262293,"h":0.015927211415500908},{"w":0.2139917755126953,"t":"Are there good hotels there?","c":1,"y":0.43895348812225188,"x":0.19341563729509262,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.19341564713774725,"w":0.60493825276692703,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.4534746762566001,"c":1,"t":"Yes - some very nice ones and there are also a few basic hostels and campsites."},{"c":1,"t":"It's great if you need lessons as the surf schools are excellent.","w":0.46090535481770845,"x":0.19341563524005204,"y":0.46790341568906202,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"y":0.48255813941802139,"w":0.10493827184041338,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Sounds good.","x":0.19341563763508618,"c":1},{"y":0.49705535919171528,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.55967076619466138,"c":1,"x":0.19341564560285235,"t":"Yes and there's lots to see in the area - like those well-known cliffs - ... I've"},{"c":1,"y":0.51148409918133786,"t":"forgotten the name of them ...","h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.1913580242493885,"w":0.22427983601888021},{"x":0.19341563443409465,"y":0.52616279058764515,"w":0.27160494486490883,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"Oh don't worry - I can look them up."},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1,"t":"I've also been surfing in County Mayo, which is less well-known for surfing,","x":0.19341566133006721,"y":0.53916372210830454,"w":0.55555552164713551},{"t":"but we had a really good time. That was a few years ago when the kids were","x":0.19341564970689737,"y":0.55377906999351056,"w":0.56790120442708325,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1},{"w":0.44855967203776048,"x":0.19135802392687362,"y":0.56831395337859447,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"younger. There's a good surf school at Carrowniskey beach.","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"How do you spell that?","x":0.1934156350099917,"y":0.5827444052668207,"w":0.17078189849853515,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"c":1,"w":0.23868311564127601,"x":0.19135803055474224,"y":0.59738372082068469,"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"C-A-double R-O-W-N-I-S-K-E-Y"},{"x":0.19135802443149391,"t":"OK.","y":0.611918604498221,"w":0.028806584676106778,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.62632508820655286,"t":"I put the kids into the surf camp they run during the summer for 10-16 year olds.","w":0.59670781453450517,"x":0.19341563995242494},{"y":0.64098837198347547,"x":0.1934156391700525,"c":1,"t":"Oh right. How long was that for?","w":0.24074073791503908,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.65547703170855975,"c":1,"x":0.19341564277765655,"w":0.57818929036458333,"t":"Three hours every day for a week. It was perfect - they were so tired out after"},{"t":"that.","c":1,"w":0.037037035624186199,"y":0.67005813939163172,"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.18930041211931978},{"y":0.68199335255469695,"w":0.10807638804117836,"c":1,"t":"I can imagine.","h":0.014466904639074407,"x":0.19290213236468773},{"t":"One thing we did while the kids were surfing was to rent some kayaks to have a","y":0.69758539484060467,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.19341564088904648,"w":0.59053497314453118},{"t":"look around the bay which is nearby. It's really beautitul.","x":0.19341563368053158,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.41563786824544269,"y":0.71366279059010607},{"w":0.16460905710856119,"t":"Oh, I'd love to do that.","x":0.19341563559483585,"y":0.72673733830669895,"h":0.01308824316772883,"c":1},{"w":0.48148147583007816,"c":1,"t":"Now the only time I went to Ireland it rained practically every day.","x":0.19341564057782856,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.76148409918549131},{"t":"Mmm yes - that can be a problem - but you can surf in the rain, you know.","w":0.55555557250976562,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.19341562927274802,"y":0.77616279059087512},{"w":0.32304527282714846,"y":0.79063604212449734,"x":0.19341563507919554,"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"It doesn't have the same appeal, somehow.","c":1},{"h":0.016514529889829044,"y":0.80184511026210381,"w":0.55991505940755204,"t":"Well, the weather's been fine the last couple of years when I've been there,","x":0.19330401804217112,"c":1},{"x":0.19341564933630062,"t":"but actually, it tends to rain more in August than in the spring or autumn.","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.81831395336621215,"w":0.53497940063476568},{"w":0.5041152445475261,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"y":0.83274440527022309,"t":"September's my favourite month because the water is warmer then.","x":0.19341562859270595},{"x":0.81893004139945635,"y":0.22238372068186485,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Q1"},{"t":"Q2","y":0.26598837191600855,"w":0.026748971939086874,"x":0.81893004067654707,"h":0.013081395583944833,"c":1},{"x":0.81893004067654707,"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"Q3","y":0.43895348821474667,"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1},{"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1,"x":0.8189300406679737,"t":"Q4","y":0.56831395331631263,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.026748971939086874,"t":"Q5","y":0.65406976725889965,"c":1,"x":0.81893004068683528,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.026748971939086874,"t":"Q6","h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.81893004067654707,"y":0.69767441844730471,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q7","x":0.81893004067654707,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.83284883706008739,"w":0.026748971939086874},{"c":1,"x":0.84773662590852594,"y":0.86773255798110183,"t":"107","w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"x":0.66991655033568553,"w":0.30612678527832038,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.95314993796778535,"h":0.03375352650564889}],"w":2400}